### Changes Made (7 total)

**Thread Fixes (1)**
- The carveout section closed on "it is not about their politics at all. **It is about his.**" — which contradicts the section's own argument (the whole point is that it *isn't* about politics, it's about doors held open). Changed to "It is about the door," which carries the image the section already built.

**Transition Fixes (5)**
- **Diagnosis → Poor**: added "That fear has an address." Reader now knows the childhood section is the origin of the dread, not a biography detour.
- **Poor → Ten Years**: added "That payout took ten years to arrive." This seam was the worst one — the piece delivered the resolution (the house) and then silently jumped back to 2012 open mics. Now the time reversal is announced.
- **Left the Podcast → Receipt**: added "Those rooms leave things behind, and he keeps all of it." Carries "room" from the generous-laugher close straight into the inventory.
- **Receipt → Weight**: added "The one thing that got him into those rooms is not in the inventory. He carries it." This was the closest thing to a broken seam (furniture → body, no connection).
- **Weight → Carveout**: replaced the generic pivot ("This is the part of him that a smart reader should push on") with "He can subtract from his own plate. There is one subtraction he refuses..." — uses the piece's own subtraction vocabulary and makes the later "He just will not do the subtraction" land as a callback.

**Internal Flow Fixes (1)**
- Diagnosis section had a parallel bridge pair ("His stated ambition matches." / "His stated fear matches too."). Changed the second to "He is equally specific about the alternative," which also carries the *boss → regular job* keyword.

